 leaves  streams          iid cos   shared ratio   offset ratio  permute ratio
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
      1        2   0.4345+-0.0013   0.984+-0.005   0.997+-0.004   0.986+-0.005
      2        4   0.3296+-0.0008   0.960+-0.004   0.995+-0.004   0.964+-0.004
